{"t": 1793284097417, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "replay_end", "Restoration playback (T, and the automatic reveal) ends on the finished cabin with the player's own avatar standing on the rug squarely in front of the newly lit fire, blocking the hearth, and Ada in the rocking chair shows only as a purple skirt: the quilt over the chair back hides her upper body and face. The money shot of the game is obscured. See shots/t10.png and shots/replay_grid.png (shot taken now shows the world after playback)."]}
