{"t": 1793284212248, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "ada_sideways", "Ada Lark in the rocking chair (Done step, tick ~32000) sits turned about 90 degrees from the chair: the quilted chair back is at her right side instead of behind her, the near armrest passes through her lap and her skirt pokes out past the rockers. From the hearth side she reads as perched sideways on the chair. Expected her seated facing the same way as the chair, back against the quilt."]}
