{"t": 1793284268001, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "mare_stall_label", "Standing at the stall fence with the crosshair squarely on the mare's body, the aim label reads 'Stall' (no hint), not the mare; pt walkto mare also stops 2.8 m away, 'stuck' against the fence. The stall's pick volume seems to swallow the mare, so a player can't tell how to tend her (curry comb 9) from here. Expected the mare's name and a hint when aimed at her."]}
