{"t": 1793284361398, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "no_chimney_outside", "With the hearth lit and Ada home (Done, ~3:28 pm), the cabin seen from the yard and from the west side has no stone chimney stack above the roof and no smoke or glow at all, although inside there is a full stone chimney breast. The 'firelit chimney' payoff of the Kindle step is invisible from outside; the warm cabin looks exactly as it did before. Expected a chimney stack through the roof with smoke once the fire is lit."]}
